==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Excadrill|96}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Slashing Claw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Salazzle|99}} and {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Noctowl|166}}, both from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

